<title>USA: Polyphase names James Rudis president.</title>
<headline>Polyphase names James Rudis president.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polyphase Corp said Thursday it named James Rudis, formerly an executive vice president, as its new president.</p>
<p>He takes on the post from Paul Tanner, president since December 1992. Tanner will continue as chairman.</p>
<p>Polyphase is a holding company with operations in the frozen food, forestry equipment and electronics industries.</p>
